 "structural_change": "MU-S81/KIT 10-19: NEW leaf dsdv_mu_hslot (MU-S81/HOST f9e3b8412 / 4fce073bd): the S81 host plane's static outstanding-token slot table, NSLOT 47 (47 AR users) x {user 10, pos 21, due 32}; taps f_ks / f_kd beside dsdv_seq_host's L0 (sh_lk), emits t_ku {v, user, pos} on the edge of the unit's t_kd done (0 added cycles), sticky faults t_mf (collision / off-calendar or dup / return mismatch / config). The unit wrapper dsdv_seq_host_mu (= dsdv_seq_host + this leaf, t_kd spare 32 bits) is soft glue in the seq_host parent: no closed leaf of dsdv_seq_host (sh_lk / sh_sq / sh_vc CLOSED / sh_ft) changes. Faces: taps + boot config W, t_ku / t_mf E (to the wrapper's t_kd merge), ck / rst_n S.",
